  "userIcons": null,
  "aiFeedback": "Single import exposes nine localhost-only HTTP endpoints. The action viewer is a persistent top overlay updated through /rab/stream and dismissed through its X or /rab/clear. Dismissing the viewer does not stop RAB or the remote session. HTTP server port is configured in MacroDroid settings; default 8080. Enable accessibility service for screen operations."
